            "column_two": "<h4><strong>REFUND POLICY</strong></h4><p>WE WILL ALLOW A CHANGE OF MIND RETURN FOR REFUND OR EXCHANGE, PROVIDED THAT THE ITEM IN QUESTION IS:</p><ul><li>Purchased at www.2xu.com;</li><li>Returned within 30 days of purchase from www.2xu.com;</li><li>In original purchased condition with tags attached;</li><li>In original & undamaged packaging;</li><li>Has not been worn;</li><li>Not underwear or socks; and</li><li>Not damaged in any way</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>*Outlet items are final sale</strong><br/>You can find our full return policy <a href=\"/pages/returns-and-exchanges\" title=\"Return Policy\">here<br/></a>You can make a return <a href=\"https://2xu.loopreturns.com/#/\" title=\"https://2xu.loopreturns.com/#/\">here</a></p>"
