            "column_two": "<h4><strong>For Wetsuit care instructions:</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0518/4087/6699/files/250117_Wetsuit_Care_A4.pdf?v=1738039982\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wetsuit Care Guide\">Click Here</a></p><h4><strong>For Trisuit care instructions:</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0518/4087/6699/files/250117_Trisuit_Care_A4.pdf?v=1738039982\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Trisuit Care Guide\">Click Here</a></p><h4><strong>For Light Speed React Singlet care instructions:</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0518/4087/6699/files/241216_LSR_AFTERCARD_CARD.pdf?v=1740521994\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LSR Singlet Care\">Click Here</a></p>"
